# BusyBox init for NextUI H700 base OS.
# Kernel runs /init -> /sbin/init (busybox) which reads this file.
# First line: raw liveness marker into the sacrificial p6 stub (offset 4 MiB)
# — proves init+sh ran even if every filesystem mount later fails.
::sysinit:/bin/sh -c 'echo "BASEOS-INIT-ALIVE" | dd of=/dev/mmcblk0p6 bs=512 seek=8196 conv=notrunc 2>/dev/null'
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
::respawn:/sbin/nextui-session
# Serial console on the debug UART (dev builds; harmless without a cable).
ttyS0::respawn:/sbin/getty -L ttyS0 115200 vt100
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/etc/init.d/rcK
::restart:/sbin/init
